        <p>
          The Pay Matrix structure eliminates subjective grading by distributing central government designations into specific functional bands. Understanding your classification ensures accurate salary projections post-8th CPC implementation.
        </p>
        
        <div class="matrix-grid-summary">
          <div class="matrix-box">
